<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Zuki: That’s right.\nThis where we welcome LUGIA.\rWhen the dance we practiced for days\nbecomes one with the sound of the\fTidal Bell we gave you, then\fLUGIA gon’ rise up from the\fwaterfall basin again!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s all we can do for you...\nWhat you do now is on you...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That IS LUGIA...\nThe guardian of these islands\fsince forever...\rSo many tried over and over,\nand came up short...\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your heart in total\nsync with the Tidal Bell finally\fmade it show up...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you see it?\rLUGIA... It been waitin’ for\nsomebody like you this whole time.\fRight...?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">LUGIA: Gyaaas!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You did amazin’. Tell\nProfessor Elm we said wassup.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ain’t just got LUGIA to show,\nyou caught it too...\rYou incredible.\nWe got nothin’ else to say.\rTake care of yourself out there...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If that’s what you believe, we\nain’t gon’ try to change your mind.\rStill, if you wanna see LUGIA again,\nmaybe come back here\fafter everythin’ settle down...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0125_D40R0107_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I think once you turn your back\non it, LUGIA won’t come back for\fa while...\rIf you wanna see LUGIA, maybe\ncome back here after everythin’\fsettle down...</language>
	</row>
</body>
